# N4 slice 1, staged (Codex OPUS-CODEX-20261015-23 Q3; LMX_semantics.ru.md #method-parts): the output m of
# receiveMessage is a typed Structure reference of the code, a place of the data admitted only through implements.
# Refused at the receiver until that admission is built.
Letter:
    int: v 0
end: Letter
S:
    int: x 1
    receiveMessage: m Letter
    x: x + 1
end: S
D:
